Credited ideas, no code used

  - florilegium, Kevin Raymond (MIT): https://github.com/kevinraymond/florilegium
    Growing a composition by filling the largest hole first, which led to
    fillDots in fill.js. The method is from Wong, Zongker and Salesin,
    "Computer-Generated Floral Ornament" (SIGGRAPH 1998).
  - Amanda Ghassaei, "Digital Marbling" (2022):
    https://blog.amandaghassaei.com/2022/10/25/digital-marbling/
    The target look, and rakes as forces on the flow.

